Required env (see internal/config):
  TARGET_FILES_SVC_ADDR          gRPC host:port for files-svc.
  OIDC_ISSUER_URL                    Keycloak realm issuer URL.
  KEYCLOAK_CLIENT_SECRET             Service-account client secret.
  NATS_URL                           NATS URL for cursor bucket.
  LEGACY_MEMGRAPH_URI                bolt:// URI for legacy Memgraph (taxonomy apply phases).
  LEGACY_POSTGRES_DSN                postgres:// DSN for legacy monolith (corpora apply onward).
  LEGACY_QDRANT_URL                  Legacy Qdrant URL (embeddings apply).
  LEGACY_DOCS_DIR                    Filesystem root for legacy document files (documents apply).
  NEW_MINIO_ENDPOINT                 New-platform MinIO endpoint (documents apply).
