Required flags for entity-types / relationship-types / corpora / documents / chunks apply:
  --org-id <uuid>                  UUID of the org in the new platform
  --legacy-org-id <int>            Numeric organization_id in legacy Postgres / Memgraph
  --corpus-legacy-id-map <path>    (documents apply only) JSON sidecar from
                                   prior corpora apply (default <RUN_DIR>/corpus_map.json)
  --document-legacy-id-map <path>  (chunks / embeddings apply only) JSON sidecar from
                                   prior documents apply (default <RUN_DIR>/document_map.json)
  --entity-type-legacy-id-map <path>  (entities apply only) JSON sidecar from
